      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The 22‑room Taylor’s Mansion, built in 1899 by Lafe Taylor, has served as a residence, hotel, boarding house, nursing home, and even a haunted house.",
